---
title: Order handling
---
flowchart TD
    start([New order]) --> check{In stock?}
    check -- yes --> pay[Take payment]
    check -- no --> back[[Back-order]]
    back -.-> notify>Email the customer]
    pay --> ok{Paid?}
    ok -->|yes| ship[(Warehouse queue)]
    ok -->|no| cancel[Cancel order]
    ship --> done((Done))
    cancel --> done
    subgraph Fulfilment
        ship
        done
    end
    classDef warn fill:#fdecea,stroke:#c0392b,color:#7b1d14
    class cancel warn
